{"id":"40ea3f7b8ae35394","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-parabolic-subgroup.md","title":"Parabolic Subgroup","display":"df-parabolic-subgroup — Parabolic Subgroup","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-parabolic-subgroup","aliases":["58-df-parabolic-subgroup"],"display":"df-parabolic-subgroup — Parabolic Subgroup","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-parabolic-subgroup"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-parabolic-subgroup</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-parabolic-subgroup — Parabolic Subgroup"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"07ee726a6e15b274\" href=\"?note=07ee726a6e15b274\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md\">../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md\">../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,G,P,B,m,i,e\\in V\">\\(k,G,P,B,m,i,e\\in V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"07ee726a6e15b274\" href=\"?note=07ee726a6e15b274\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md\">../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md\">../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZariskiClosedSubgroup}_S,\\mathrm{ConnectedAlgebraicSubgroup}_S,\\mathrm{BorelSubgroup}_S,\\mathrm{ParabolicSubgroup}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZariskiClosedSubgroup}_S,\\mathrm{ConnectedAlgebraicSubgroup}_S,\\mathrm{BorelSubgroup}_S,\\mathrm{ParabolicSubgroup}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SolvableSubgroup}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{SolvableSubgroup}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Parabolic}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Parabolic}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parabolic\\text{-}zariski\\text{-}closed\\text{-}subgroup}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZariskiClosedSubgroup}_S(H,k,G,m,i,e)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k(G,m,i,e)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists I\\subseteq k[x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}]\\;\n\\Bigl(G\\subseteq k^n\\land\nH=\\{a\\in G:\\forall q\\in I\\;(q(a)=0_k)\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parabolic\\text{-}zariski\\text{-}closed\\text{-}subgroup}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZariskiClosedSubgroup}_S(H,k,G,m,i,e)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k(G,m,i,e)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists I\\subseteq k[x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}]\\;\n\\Bigl(G\\subseteq k^n\\land\nH=\\{a\\in G:\\forall q\\in I\\;(q(a)=0_k)\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parabolic\\text{-}connected\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}subgroup}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ConnectedAlgebraicSubgroup}_S(H,k,G,m,i,e)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZariskiClosedSubgroup}_S(H,k,G,m,i,e)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(G\\subseteq k^n\\land\n\\forall A,C\\subseteq H\\;\\Bigl[\n\\exists I,J\\subseteq k[x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}]\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(A=\\{a\\in H:\\forall q\\in I\\;(q(a)=0_k)\\}\n\\land C=\\{a\\in H:\\forall q\\in J\\;(q(a)=0_k)\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land H=A\\cup C\\land A\\cap C=\\varnothing\n\\to A=\\varnothing\\lor C=\\varnothing\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parabolic\\text{-}connected\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}subgroup}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ConnectedAlgebraicSubgroup}_S(H,k,G,m,i,e)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZariskiClosedSubgroup}_S(H,k,G,m,i,e)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(G\\subseteq k^n\\land\n\\forall A,C\\subseteq H\\;\\Bigl[\n\\exists I,J\\subseteq k[x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}]\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\bigl(A=\\{a\\in H:\\forall q\\in I\\;(q(a)=0_k)\\}\n\\land C=\\{a\\in H:\\forall q\\in J\\;(q(a)=0_k)\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land H=A\\cup C\\land A\\cap C=\\varnothing\n\\to A=\\varnothing\\lor C=\\varnothing\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parabolic\\text{-}solvable\\text{-}subgroup}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SolvableSubgroup}_S(H,G,m,i,e)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,m)\\land\n\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\exists D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(D,r+1,\\mathcal P(H))\n\\land D(0)=H\\land D(r)=\\{e\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in r\\;\\Bigl[\nD(t+1)=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{K\\subseteq D(t):\n\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\bigl(K,D(t),m\\upharpoonright D(t)^2\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in D(t)\\;\nm\\bigl(\\langle m(\\langle m(\\langle x,y\\rangle),i(x)\\rangle),i(y)\\rangle\\bigr)\\in K\n\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parabolic\\text{-}solvable\\text{-}subgroup}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SolvableSubgroup}_S(H,G,m,i,e)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,m)\\land\n\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\exists D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(D,r+1,\\mathcal P(H))\n\\land D(0)=H\\land D(r)=\\{e\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in r\\;\\Bigl[\nD(t+1)=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{K\\subseteq D(t):\n\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\bigl(K,D(t),m\\upharpoonright D(t)^2\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\land\\forall x,y\\in D(t)\\;\nm\\bigl(\\langle m(\\langle m(\\langle x,y\\rangle),i(x)\\rangle),i(y)\\rangle\\bigr)\\in K\n\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parabolic\\text{-}borel\\text{-}subgroup}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BorelSubgroup}_S(B,k,G,m,i,e)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConnectedAlgebraicSubgroup}_S(B,k,G,m,i,e)\n\\land\\mathrm{SolvableSubgroup}_S(B,G,m,i,e)\n\\land\\forall H\\subseteq G\\;\\Bigl(\nB\\subseteq H\\land\n\\mathrm{ConnectedAlgebraicSubgroup}_S(H,k,G,m,i,e)\n\\land\\mathrm{SolvableSubgroup}_S(H,G,m,i,e)\\to H=B\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parabolic\\text{-}borel\\text{-}subgroup}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BorelSubgroup}_S(B,k,G,m,i,e)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ConnectedAlgebraicSubgroup}_S(B,k,G,m,i,e)\n\\land\\mathrm{SolvableSubgroup}_S(B,G,m,i,e)\n\\land\\forall H\\subseteq G\\;\\Bigl(\nB\\subseteq H\\land\n\\mathrm{ConnectedAlgebraicSubgroup}_S(H,k,G,m,i,e)\n\\land\\mathrm{SolvableSubgroup}_S(H,G,m,i,e)\\to H=B\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parabolic\\text{-}subgroup}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ParabolicSubgroup}_S(P,k,G,m,i,e)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k(G,m,i,e)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(P,G,m)\\land\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BorelSubgroup}_S(B,k,G,m,i,e)\n\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(B,P,m\\upharpoonright P^2)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parabolic\\text{-}subgroup}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ParabolicSubgroup}_S(P,k,G,m,i,e)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k(G,m,i,e)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(P,G,m)\\land\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BorelSubgroup}_S(B,k,G,m,i,e)\n\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(B,P,m\\upharpoonright P^2)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parabolic\\text{-}subgroup\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Parabolic}_S(P,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k,m,i,e\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ParabolicSubgroup}_S(P,k,G,m,i,e)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}parabolic\\text{-}subgroup\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Parabolic}_S(P,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k,m,i,e\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ParabolicSubgroup}_S(P,k,G,m,i,e)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A parabolic subgroup is a subgroup containing a Borel subgroup of the ambient algebraic group.</li>\n<li>A Borel subgroup is expanded as a maximal connected solvable Zariski-closed subgroup. Connectedness uses irreducibility against relative polynomially closed decompositions, and solvability uses the finite derived series generated by commutators.</li>\n<li>The two-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Parabolic}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Parabolic}_S\\)</span> is only an existential compatibility projection; the six-place predicate retains the field and all ambient group operations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"07ee726a6e15b274","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"59685d062adf2748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215b